2026-07-27T07:48:48.2490761Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2491283Z i /tmp/RtmpGJNpiP/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2491618Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2491955Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2492580Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2493040Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2493814Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2494338Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2692220Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:48:48.2791735Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:48:48.3130070Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:48:48.3246889Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
